
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge"/>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <meta name="description" content={assigns[:meta_description] || ""} />
    <meta name="google-site-verification" content="P-W0ubGRy46mO6HJ3NbCY1anIV_puaohUaWpWDhrmvg" />
    <%= csrf_meta_tag() %>
    <%= live_title_tag assigns[:page_title] || "", suffix: "" %>
    <meta property="og:locale" content="fr_FR">
    <meta property="og:type" content="article">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Circuits Moto Enduro Sport - Location et circuits moto à Madagascar">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Madagascar est un pays montagneux mais aussi avec des parties désertiques, pour notre plus grand plaisir. Idéal au circuit enduro sport en moto">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://moto-madagascar.com/circuit">
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Location et circuits moto à Madagascar">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://moto-madagascar.com/assets/images/section/circuit_image/733575AF-6794-45CF-9537-D31899E1B530.jpeg">
    <link phx-track-static rel="stylesheet" href={Routes.static_path(@conn, "/assets/app.css")}/>
    <script defer phx-track-static type="text/javascript" src={Routes.static_path(@conn, "/assets/app.js")}></script>
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://moto-madagascar.com/">
    <link rel="preload" rel="icon" sizes="32x32" type="image/png" href={Routes.static_path(@conn, "/assets/images/section/circuit_image/cropped-favicon-mtl-32x32.png")} />
  </head>
  
<body>
  
<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg fixed-top " style="height:1.2rem;">
  <div class="container-fluid bg-white">
    <!-- Logo -->
    <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">
      <!-- <img rel="preload" src={Routes.static_path(@conn, "/assets/images/section/logo.webp")} alt="Logo Moto Parcours" style="transform:scale(1,1)" width="130" height="30"> -->
    </a>

    <!-- Navbar Toggler (for mobile view) -->
    <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav" aria-controls="navbarNav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
      <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
    </button>

    <!-- Navbar Links -->
    <div class="collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-start" id="navbarNav">
      <ul class="navbar-nav">
        <li class="nav-item">
          <a class="nav-link mb-5" href={Routes.page_path(@conn, :index)} style="height:10px;"><i class="fa fa-home"></i> <strong>Accueil</strong></a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item">
          <a class="nav-link mb-5" href={Routes.live_path(@conn, MotoTourWeb.CircuitLive)} style="height:10px;"><i class="fa fa-motorcycle"></i> <strong>Circuits enduro</strong></a>
        </li> 
        <li class="nav-item">
          <a class="nav-link mb-5" href={Routes.page_path(@conn, :propos)} style="height:10px;"><i class="fa fa-exclamation"></i> <strong>A propos</strong></a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item">
          <a class="nav-link mb-5" href={Routes.questions_path(@conn, :new)} style="height:10px;"><i class="fa fa-envelope"></i> <strong>Contact</strong></a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
      <%= render "_user_menu.html", assigns %>
  </div>

      
</nav>

<div class="mt-4">
  <%= @inner_content %>
</div>

<footer class="bg-dark text-white">
    <!-- <div class="container"> -->
      <div class="row">
        <!-- Section : Icon -->
        <div class="col-md-3 d-flex justify-content-center" style="transform:scale(1,1)">
          <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">
            <img class="img-fluid mt-2" src={Routes.static_path(@conn, "/assets/images/section/logo.webp")} loading="lazy" alt="Logo Moto Parcours" style="width:20rem">
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Section : a propos -->
        <div class="col-md-5">
          <h5>À propos</h5>
          <p>Notre équipe franco-malgache, composée de guides moto et mécaniciens spécialisés, vous fera partager leur passion pour ce pays.

            N’attendez pas !<a href="https://www.facebook.com/MotoTourMada" class="text-white text-decoration-none"><u> Rejoignez-nous !</u></a><br>
            &copy; 2025 Moto Tour Madagascar. Tous droits réservés. |
              <a href="https://mgbi.mg/" class="text-white text-decoration-none">Site créé par <u>mgbi</u></a>
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Section : Contact -->
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <h5>Contact</h5>
          <ul class="list-unstyled">
            <li><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> Ankadifotsy, Làlana Ratsima James
              Antananarivo – Madagascar
              Ouvert de 9H à 17H</li>
            <li><i class="fa fa-whatsapp"></i> +261 32 11 028 52 </li>
            <li><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> madatraces@gmail.com </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
       

      <!-- Section : Copyright -->
      <!-- <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12 text-center">
          <p>&copy; 2024 Moto Tour Madagascar. Tous droits réservés. |
            <a href="https://mgbi.mg/" class="text-white text-decoration-none">Site créé par <u>mgbi</u></a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div> -->
    <!-- </div> -->
  </footer>
  <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.5.1.slim.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/popper.js@1.16.1/dist/umd/popper.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.5.2/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>

  </body>
</html>
